  << /ActualText (The chat does not persist between screen openings\056\nBehavior\072\nWhen the AI Coach screen is opened\072\nthe message history is empty\054\nthe initial AI starter message is sent automatically\056\nWhen the user navigates back to the main screen\072\nthe AI Coach screen is removed from the back stack\054\nthe conversation state is discarded\056\nWhen the AI Coach screen is opened again\072\nthe chat starts from scratch\054\nthe initial AI message is sent again\056\nThis approach intentionally treats each visit as a new consultation session\054 simplifying state management and avoiding outdated activity context\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 4932 0 R
     /Pg 3558 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
