  << /ActualText (This document describes the requirements for the third development milestone \050Milestone \0433\051 of the Smart Step application\056\nMilestone \0433 focuses on introducing AI\055powered user guidance and insights into the application\056 At this stage\054 the app is extended with an AI Coach that provides contextual feedback\054 motivational messages\054 and interactive recommendations based on the user\031s activity data\054 building on the tracking and analytics features implemented in Milestone \0432\056\nThe mockups define the overall appearance and expected behavior of the interface\056 Specific technical decisions \050component structure\054 state handling\054 animation implementation\051 are left to the participants\054 as long as the final result follows the described logic and interaction patterns\056\nYou can find the Smart Step mockups here\072)
